  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid Quantum Attention Deep Q-Network (QADQN) using a 4‑qubit parameterized circuit simulated in Qiskit within a classical RL pipeline. In S&P 500 backtests, QADQN achieves 78.91% return (Sharpe 0.82, Sortino 1.19) on an overlapping test window and 71.26% return (Sharpe 0.77, Sortino 1.28) on a non‑overlapping window, outperforming Buy‑and‑Hold (74.42% / 44.22%) and DDPG (31.23% / 15.94%).",
